  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Catalysing delivery of ten critical transitions (FOLU)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">FOLU will contribute to governments, businesses, civil society organisations and citizens adopting and promoting a shared goal-based vision for sustainable climate resilient food and land use system transformation for better health, environment and inclusive development.</narrative>
  </description>
